  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training for life: the sport beyond movement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to promote sport as a tool to educate children and adolescents in social and economic vulnerability in the favelas of Rio de Janeiro. For us, sport is more than a movement: it is a learning language. Through sport, we can improve the quality of life of students and their families, impacting the community and improving the territory&apos;s HDI. For this, we use sport as an instrument for physical, social, intellectual, cultural and emotional well-being.</narrative>
  </description>
